<title>UK: All four Brent dates kept - trade.</title>
<headline>All four Brent dates kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>All four Brent cargoes to be nominated from the paper chain on Friday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>They were kept by Phibro, Esso, BP and Stasco, they said.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
